        -:  973:    /** Insert elements.
        -:  974:
        -:  975:        The elements in the range `[first, last)` are inserted one at a time,
        -:  976:        in order. Any element with key that is a duplicate of a key already
        -:  977:        present in container will be skipped. This also means, that if there
        -:  978:        are two keys within the range that are equal to each other, only the
        -:  979:        first will be inserted.
        -:  980:
        -:  981:        Insertion may result in rehashing of the container. In that case all
        -:  982:        iterators and references are invalidated. Otherwise, they are not
